~ order
[wave amp=40 freq=5]Can I get a {{order.display_name}}?[/wave]
=> END

~ correct_order
[wave]Thanks![/wave]
=> END

~ incorrect_order
% [shake rate=20 level=10]What is this?[/shake]
% [shake rate=20 level=10]I didn't ask for this![/shake]
% [shake rate=20 level=10]Did you even try?[/shake]
=> END

## special customer dialogues below!!
# tutorial
~ intro_dialogue
Anya!! I didn't know you'd be at the festival!
How's Moka doing now?
He was so wild as a kitten...
I heard about your debt!
do set_expression(Customer.CustomerExpression.DISSATISFIED)
Poor Moka was so sick...
do set_expression(Customer.CustomerExpression.NEUTRAL)
...What's that?
Today's your last chance at paying it off?
You have to fill that tip jar all the way up?
Well then, you better be quick with orders...
You don't want customers leaving!
=> END 

~ took_too_long
You took too long! But I don't mind...
=> END

~ order_tutorial_black_coffee
How about a black coffee?
=> END 

~ order_tutorial_hot_chocolate
Hot chocolate this time!
=> END 

~ tutorial_correct_order
Wonderful!
=> END

~ tutorial_incorrect_order
Come on, you can do better than that!
=> END

~ tutorial_cat_warning_1
Watch out for Moka! 
He's running around at the back!
=> END

~ tutorial_cat_warning_2
I think he just swapped out your recipe list!
=> END

~ end_tutorial
Now, good luck!
Do your best, Anya!
=> END

~ good_ending
Anya...
do set_expression(Customer.CustomerExpression.NEUTRAL)
You did it!!
You filled up the tip jar!
I knew you could do it, you always do!
=> END


~ bad_ending_1
Anya...
You were supposed to try your best...
do set_expression(Customer.CustomerExpression.SATISFIED)
But it's fine, really!
do set_expression(Customer.CustomerExpression.NEUTRAL)
I'll always have your back!
=> END

~ bad_ending_2
Next year's festival will be a success, surely!
=> END